Date: Sat, 26 Sep 2026 12:40:31 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Sign in with Telegram, run KH Invoice from the SaveIt KH bot,
 new Home

- Mini App: opened from the bot, the page signs in by itself with Telegram's
  signed initData (first visit creates the account with a 30-day trial).
- Browser: "Sign in with Telegram" confirms a one-time code in the bot.
- Existing phone accounts can connect Telegram from Home or Account.
- Plans can be paid in the bot (KHQR / ABA); the telegram-bridge edge
  function switches the plan on through the existing subscription trigger.
- Home: one hero with balance, today's income/expense and the plan status.
- profiles: users can no longer write their own Telegram link or billing
  fields (subscription_expires_at, is_locked, trial_started_at).

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
